OL,3,AJailed teacher convicted of sexual
OL,4,Aabuse secretly released early in
OL,5,AIndonesia, BBC finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Indonesian teacher convicted of
OL,8,Fsexually assaulting a student at an
OL,9,FIslamic boarding school has been
OL,10,Fsecretly released from prison early, a
OL,11,FBBC Eye investigation has found.
OL,13,FMoch Subchi Azal Tsani or Bechi, as he
OL,14,Fis known, is the son of an influential
OL,15,FIslamic religious leader. His trial
OL,16,Fsent shockwaves through Indonesia, a
OL,17,FMuslim-majority country where millions
OL,18,Fof parents send their children to
OL,19,FIslamic boarding schools.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
