OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJailed teacher convicted of sexual
OL,4,Aabuse secretly released early in
OL,5,AIndonesia, BBC finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was arrested in 2022 at his father's
OL,8,Fschool in East Java where he had
OL,9,Ftaught, after a 15-hour siege involving
OL,10,Fnearly 1,000 riot police - his family's
OL,11,Fsupporters had gathered in large
OL,12,Fnumbers to prevent his arrest. He was
OL,13,Fsentenced to seven years in prison
OL,14,Flater that year.
OL,16,FThe government withdrew the school's
OL,17,Foperating licence, but then President
OL,18,FJoko Widodo intervened to keep the
OL,19,Fschool open, arguing that the case
OL,20,Finvolved an individual rather than the
OL,21,Finstitution.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
